{"title":"Lycan Claw","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Werewolf, Alpha Werewolf</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>What it’s for</h2><p>An <b>enchant reagent</b>. Each <b>infuse</b> (one carat more) of one of these uses one:</p><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>of Destruction</b> <span class=\"muted\">(gems: Ruby + Ruby + Ruby)</span></li><li><b>of the Mastiff</b> <span class=\"muted\">(gems: Diamond + Ruby + Ruby)</span></li><li><b>Onyx rings and pendants</b> <span class=\"muted\">(their gem: <a href=\"#/item/gem-onyx\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"\">Gem Onyx</a>)</span></li></ul><p><b>Dropped by</b> <b>Werewolf</b>: <a href=\"#/monster/lycan\">Lycan</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/werewolf\">Werewolf</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf\">Alpha Werewolf</a><br><b>Moonlit Beast</b>: <a href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox\">Glimmerfox</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/pale-hart\">Pale Hart</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/moonhart\">Moonhart</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/white-unicorn\">White Unicorn</a>, about 1 kill in 500 (an elite 1 in 50).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a> for the odds and fees, and <a href=\"#/guide/reagents\">Reagents</a> for every reagent.</p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"alpha-werewolf\" title=\"Alpha Werewolf - dropped it in 1 of 136 looted corpses (1/136)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fc7711ec9ecca6b88e5c.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Alpha Werewolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/136<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"werewolf\" title=\"Werewolf - dropped it in 4 of 1,406 looted corpses (1/352)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0ebf199ce603121d6b69.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/352<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"lycan-claw\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/5886e8298d88b1961766.svg\" alt=\"Lycan Claw\"></div><h3>Lycan Claw</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/28/2026, 7:00:55 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}